    "sections": {
        "description": "Hotel Booking WDA is a responsive and multipurpose WordPress theme. The theme is a great solution for hotel, villa, resort, tour, or travel booking websites. You can use this theme for other types of sites too, it's up to you. The theme has a beautiful and dark design that will surely impress your website visitors. WordPress hotel booking theme has many benefits and great features, so we will mention some of them. First, the theme is fully responsive and looks great on all devices (desktop, tablet, mobile). Nowadays, most users use their mobile phones to search the internet, and it is a big plus when your website looks great on mobile devices. Another great benefit of our theme is the different layout sizes. There are three global layout sizes: normal, wide, and full-width. Additionally, separate layout options are available for sidebars. This means you can choose to show or hide the sidebar for different page types (post, page, blog, search, shop/shop category, product page). The top bar and header also have different layouts, so you can use the one you like best. The WordPress hotel booking theme is fully integrated with WooCommerce and this is another benefit that can be mentioned. This means you can create a fully functional online store using our theme and WooCommerce plugin. There are a lot of options available for your shop and product pages, from design customization to the extra features we've added for WooCommerce. We also recommend you to use our \"Booking calendar, Appointment Booking System\" plugin to create online bookings and accept payments. It is a free plugin but also has a premium version. This is a great plugin with a lot of features. Our hotel booking theme is fully customizable, which is another big plus. You can change almost every element and set your own design if you need. You can check out our theme demo page and see the theme in action or install it and test it yourself."
    },
